


Huaputa tuhi: ['Number:'].
>> a := Tau + Tau + 1.
a := Tau - 2.
a := Tau × 2.
a := Tau ÷ 2.
Huaputa tuhi: a.
Huaputa rārangi-hou.

Huaputa tuhi: ['String:'].
Huaputa tuhi: Aho roa.
Huaputa rārangi-hou.

Huaputa tuhi: ['File:'].
Huaputa tuhi: Kōnae pānui.
Huaputa tuhi: (Kōnae tuhi: ['test']).
Huaputa tuhi: (Kōnae tāpiri-muri: ['test']).
Huaputa tuhi: Kōnae muku.
Huaputa tuhi: Kōnae kei-te-noho.
Huaputa tuhi: Kōnae include.
Huaputa tuhi: Kōnae tīmata.
Huaputa rārangi-hou.


Huaputa tuhi: ['Array:'].
Huaputa tuhi: Rārangi tango-whakamutunga.
Huaputa tuhi: Rārangi tatau.
Huaputa tuhi: (((Rārangi tāpiri-muri: 999) aho) whakakapihia: ['Lĳst'] me: ['List']).
Huaputa tuhi: Rārangi tatau.
Huaputa tuhi: Rārangi tango-tuatahi.
Huaputa tuhi: (Rārangi honoa: [',']).
>> f := Rārangi hou.
Huaputa tuhi: f tatau. 
Huaputa rārangi-hou.

Huaputa tuhi: ['Map:'].
Huaputa tuhi: Papakupu tatau.
Huaputa tuhi: (Papakupu tuku: ['a'] kei: ['b'])  tatau. 
Huaputa rārangi-hou.




